        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m playing my first solo game that I plan to finish now and I discarded all the cards in hand (hypothetical other player) from one hero to destroy the Toxic Seaweed environment card. Now this hero doesn&#39;t have a hand of cards. Then the next villain card that was played was Baron Blade&#39;s &quot;Consider The Price of Victory makes each player discard 1 card...but one of my heroes (the one that destroyed Toxic Seaweed) doesn&#39;t have a hand of cards.</p><p>what happens next? Does that hero immediately draw 4 cards after discarding hand? Or does she (The Wraith) continue to play the game without a regular hand; depending entirely on drawing cards from the draw phase and abilties that allow card drawing?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
