      {
        "id": 76906,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-11T22:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You stay with no hand. If something tells you to discard a card (like Consider the Price), you just cant discard since you have no cards to discard. I think Consider the Price does more damage if less cards are discarded that way (and this is why)</p><p>Also, keep in mind that if you do not play a card and use a power during one turn, you may draw an extra card in your draw phase. So if your Wraith has no hand, an option is to skip playing a card and skip using a power to draw 2 cards.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:57:42.688Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 8825,
        "topic_slug": "what-to-do-after-discarding-your-hand-of-cards",
        "display_username": "Foote",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
