        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>You stay with no hand. If something tells you to discard a card (like Consider the Price), you just cant discard since you have no cards to discard. I think Consider the Price does more damage if less cards are discarded that way (and this is why)</p><p>Also, keep in mind that if you do not play a card and use a power during one turn, you may draw an extra card in your draw phase. So if your Wraith has no hand, an option is to skip playing a card and skip using a power to draw 2 cards.&nbsp;</p>",
