        "raw": "[quote=\"Ameena\"]\nNote also that if something tells you you can &quot;discard your hand&quot; to do something (like Toxic Seaweed), a hand of zero cards is still a hand, so you can still &quot;discard&quot; it :).\n[/quote]\n\nIt has, however, been ruled that an Incapacitated hero no longer has a hand at all, and thus they cannot discard their hand.&nbsp; They <em>can</em> skip their turn, though...their turn normally consists of using one of their incap abilities, but they can give that up to delay a Self-Destruct Sequence or the like.\n",
