      {
        "id": 76909,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-12T10:19:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's true - I wasn't thinking of Incapped heroes, just active ones, but yeah, incapped heroes have no cards except their character card (which doesn't count) and so their turn becomes Start phase, Incapped Ability phase, End phase. The only time they <span class=\"bbcode-i\">don't</span> get this is if playing in the FInal Wasteland and killed by an environment target while Unforgiving Wasteland is out. But that's true of <span class=\"bbcode-i\">anything</span> destroyed in such a manner (though \"destroyed\" is the wrong word as stuff which gets \"eaten\" like that explicitly <span class=\"bbcode-i\">isn't</span> destroyed, which is why having the Final Wasteland eat all of Lilian's Fowl is so much fun &gt;:)).</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:57:42.935Z",
